    "summary": "Model eligibility — BIG MEK. A friendly unit with ORKS WALKER in the bearer’s 3\" radius gives it Lone Operative. BIG MEK units cannot meet this condition. While that condition holds, you can choose a friendly unit with ORKS WALKER during your Shooting phase. It must be within the bearer’s 3\" radius. Attacks from the chosen unit can re-roll 1s on hit rolls until turn end.",
